{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19607","headline":"省试观庆云图 · 李行敏","name":"省试观庆云图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缣素传休祉，丹青状庆云。\n非烟凝漠漠，似盖乍纷纷。\n尚驻从龙意，全舒捧日文。\n光因五色起，影向九霄分。\n裂素观嘉瑞，披图贺圣君。\n宁同窥汗漫，方此覩氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李行敏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}